<title>CANADA: DBRS removes Talisman from review list.</title>
<headline>DBRS removes Talisman from review list.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dominion Bond Rating Service Ltd said on Monday it removed Talisman Energy Inc from its under review list, following Talisman's unsuccessful takeover attempt for Wascana Energy Inc.</p>
<p>DBRS said it confirmed its ratings of Talisman's unsecured debentures and medium term notes at A with a stable trend and commercial paper at R-1 (low) with a stable trend.</p>
<p>Talisman's C$1.8 billion cash and stock bid for Wascana expired on Friday after Talisman said it would not raise its offer. A C$2-billion all-cash offer for Wascana from Canadian Occidental Petroleum Ltd expires late on Monday.</p>
<p>((Reuters Calgary Bureau (403) 531-1624))</p>
</text>
